  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">°F = °C × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; °C = (°F − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result:</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML file with form controls and output."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #2b2b2b;\n  --card-bg: #3c3c3c;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --accent: #ffa500;\n  --accent-hover: #ffb733;\n  --border: #5a5a5a;\n  --error: #ff6b6b;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 32px;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n}\n\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #aaa;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  background: #222;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: inherit;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\ninput:hover, select:hover {\n  border-color: #888;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.result-box {\n  background: #1e1e1e;\n  border: 2px dashed var(--border);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  color: #aaa;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n#result {\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n#result.error {\n  color: var(--error);\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n  .formula {\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style themed CSS with responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n  const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  const directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\n  const convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\n  const resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert() {\n    const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n    const num = parseFloat(raw);\n    if (raw === '' || !isFinite(num)) {\n      resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n      resultOutput.classList.add('error');\n      return;\n    }\n    let result;\n    if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n      result = num * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    } else {\n      result = (num - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    }\n    resultOutput.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n    resultOutput.classList.remove('error');\n  }\n\n  convertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n  tempInput.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      convert();\n    }\n  });\n});",
      "description": "JavaScript logic for conversion and error handling."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style temperature converter built with HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit and vice versa.\n- Uses formulas: °F = °C × 9/5 + 32 and °C = (°F − 32) × 5/9.\n- Displays result with exactly two decimal places.\n- Shows \"Error\" for empty or invalid input.\n- Keyboard accessible with labels and focus states.\n- Responsive design down to 360px width.\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature value.\n3. Select direction (Celsius to Fahrenheit or Fahrenheit to Celsius).\n4. Click \"Convert\" or press Enter.\n5. The result appears below.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and controls\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – conversion logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "README with instructions and details."
    }
  ]
